@startuml
title User Flow\n<size:12>WashU Delivery</size>

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BDB76B
skinparam maxMessageSize 160

|Customer|
start
:Visit landing page **/**;

|Web App (Next.js)|
:Render marketing page;

|Customer|
:Click **Log In** or **Get Started**;

|Web App (Next.js)|
if (Has valid **auth-token** cookie?) then (yes)
else (no)
  |Customer|
  :Sign up or log in at **/login**;
  |Web App (Next.js)|
  :POST /api/signup or /api/signin
  bcrypt check vs Supabase **users**
  set 7-day JWT cookie;
endif
:Show vendor grid **/dashboard**
(8 hard-coded campus vendors);

|Customer|
:Pick a vendor;

|Web App (Next.js)|
:Show menu + cart at **/dashboard/[vendor]**;
note right
  Menu is mocked: same
  3 items for every vendor.
  No payment (out of scope).
end note

|Customer|
:Add items to cart
choose drop-off
submit order;

|Web App (Next.js)|
:POST /api/orders
look up vendor + drop-off coordinates;

|Backend Services|
:gRPC **OrderHandler.InsertOrder**
→ save to Supabase **orders** + **orderItems**
(status = "pending"); <<#FFE0B2>>
note right
  <color:#E65100><b>Not wired:</b></color>
  handler is commented out
  in authoritative/main.go
end note
if (Order saved?) then (no — today)
  |Web App (Next.js)|
  :API returns 500
  "Failed to create order"; <<#FFCDD2>>
  |Customer|
  :Sees error on menu page
  no redirect, order lost; <<#FFCDD2>>
  stop
else (yes — once wired)
endif
|Backend Services|
:Matcher pairs order with
next idle robot (every 1s)
(in memory, not saved); <<#FFE0B2>>
note right
  Loop runs, but only
  InsertOrder feeds it orders
end note
:Dispatch: plan route + ETA
vendor → waypoints → drop-off
send route to robot; <<#FFE0B2>>
note right
  <color:#E65100><b>Stub only:</b></color>
  internal/routing + dispatch.
  Robot does local planning
  on board (not in this repo)
end note

|Web App (Next.js)|
:Redirect to **/order/[id]**;

|Customer|
repeat
  :Watch tracking page
  (status card, timeline, robot ID);
  |Web App (Next.js)|
  :Poll GET /api/orders/[id] every 5s;
  |Backend Services|
  :Update order status
  pending → preparing → ready → in_transit; <<#FFE0B2>>
  |Robot & Fleet|
  :Robot picks up at vendor
  drives to drop-off; <<#FFE0B2>>
  if (Robot gets stuck?) then (yes)
    :Robot requests help
    (HELP_REQUESTED);
    :Operator takes over via
    fleet console (TELEOP lease);
  else (no)
  endif
  |Customer|
repeat while (Order delivered?) is (not yet)
-> yes;

|Robot & Fleet|
:Robot arrives at drop-off
(AT_DROPOFF); <<#FFE0B2>>

|Customer|
:Meet robot and collect order; <<#FFE0B2>>

|Backend Services|
:Mark order **delivered**; <<#FFE0B2>>

|Robot & Fleet|
:Robot returns (RETURNING → IDLE); <<#FFE0B2>>

|Customer|
:Order received; <<#C8E6C9>>
stop

legend bottom
  |<back:#E8F5E9>    </back>| Implemented today |
  |<back:#FFE0B2>    </back>| Planned / not yet wired up |
  |<back:#FFCDD2>    </back>| What happens today (failure) |
endlegend
@enduml
